[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_21300100_03_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_21300100_03_0010","text":"呵呵──……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_21300100_03_0020","text":"给凛世挑衣服太开心了……\n抱歉，让你陪我逛了这么久"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_21300100_03_0030","text":"累不累？还好吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_21300100_03_0031","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_21300100_03_0040","text":"凛世也是……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_21300100_03_0050","text":"非常……开心……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_21300100_03_0060","text":"那就好……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_21300100_03_0061","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_21300100_03_0070","text":"呐，下次再一起去吧……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_21300100_03_0080","text":"下次试试整套搭配也不错呢\n我还有很多推荐的店哦！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_21300100_03_0090","text":"……\n呵呵……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_21300100_03_0100","text":"好的……\n……我很乐意"}]
